{
  "version": 2,
  "generatedAt": "2026-10-22T04:46:11.627Z",
  "lineId": "dufu",
  "kind": "period",
  "audioQuestId": "p1",
  "title": "读书壮游",
  "range": "712–745",
  "count": 19,
  "items": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n2",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "这位小兄弟，看你风尘仆仆，也是出门游历的？在下杜甫，字子美。幸会幸会。",
      "digest": "8fd46c42",
      "fileName": "n2.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n2",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n2.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n2b",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "好！出门在外，最难得的就是遇上同道中人。不知小兄弟这一路，可有什么见闻？",
      "digest": "bd64d27e",
      "fileName": "n2b.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n2b",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n2b.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n2c",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "你问这书箧？里面装的可都是我的宝贝。对了，不瞒你说——我七岁就会写诗了。",
      "digest": "aa2f5117",
      "fileName": "n2c.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n2c",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n2c.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n2d",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "text": "哈哈，不必拘束。我看你也是初到此地吧？先缓一缓，咱们边走边聊。",
      "digest": "1be79a64",
      "fileName": "n2d.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n2d",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n2d.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n3",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "我七岁时就写下\"开口咏凤凰\"，九岁能写满一囊大字。祖父杜审言是名满天下的大诗人，家学如此，我哪敢懈怠。倒是你，小兄弟——你七岁的时候，在做些什么？",
      "digest": "58f75031",
      "fileName": "n3.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n3",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n3.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n5",
      "emotion": "thoughtful",
      "text": "祖父的诗，父亲的家训，还有洛阳城里听不完的歌、看不完的画。我像块吸水的海绵，什么都想装进来。",
      "digest": "7eb0f6f9",
      "fileName": "n5.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n5",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n5.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n6",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "好眼力！凤凰非梧桐不栖，非醴泉不饮。我那时不懂什么大道理，只觉这鸟儿气度不凡，便脱口而出了。",
      "digest": "bbb9c5b4",
      "fileName": "n6.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n6",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n6.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n7",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "text": "哈哈，何必惭愧。每个人的路不同，我不过是早走了几步。你这一路走来，定也有你自己的见识。",
      "digest": "0fc9c7a1",
      "fileName": "n7.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n7",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n7.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n8",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "text": "我二十岁起游吴越，看尽了烟雨；如今又到齐赵，要登这泰山。读万卷书，行万里路，缺一不可。只是说起科场，我也不瞒你——来齐赵之前，我在洛阳落过一回榜。",
      "digest": "e05ee4bc",
      "fileName": "n8.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n8",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n8.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n10",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "text": "我若真这么想，便不是我了。落榜就落榜，我要去齐赵——去射猎，去唱歌，去看看这天下到底有多大。一张榜能困住人半生，却困不住一颗还想走远路的心。",
      "digest": "cd11b722",
      "fileName": "n10.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n10",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n10.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n11",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "你懂我！放榜那日，旁人垂头丧气，我却早把心思飞到了泰山上。人这一生，若只盯着脚下的泥，就看不见头顶的山。走，我们这就动身！",
      "digest": "83d5b54a",
      "fileName": "n11.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n11",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n11.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n12",
      "emotion": "thoughtful",
      "text": "后来我登上泰山，写下\"会当凌绝顶，一览众山小\"。你可知那一刻，我在想什么？",
      "digest": "f5965729",
      "fileName": "n12.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n12",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n12.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n14",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "倒也不全是。落第的委屈，早在马背上颠散了。剩下的，是一股说不上来的劲儿——这山我不登，也自有别人登；可我想知道，登上去的人眼里，天下是什么样子。",
      "digest": "38dc502f",
      "fileName": "n14.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n14",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n14.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n15",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "text": "说得好。\"致君尧舜上，再使风俗淳\"——这是我一生的志向。山高人为峰，我偏要站到最高处。只是站上去，不是为了俯瞰，是为了把这天下看得更清楚些。",
      "digest": "5c694586",
      "fileName": "n15.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n15",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n15.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n16",
      "emotion": "thoughtful",
      "text": "你这话倒让我一怔。是啊，山这么高，人这么小……可正因如此，才更想试试，人能走到哪一步。人若没个向上的念想，和这山里的石头，又有什么分别。",
      "digest": "b540ab08",
      "fileName": "n16.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n16",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n16.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n17",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "我听说，李白先生也在这一带游历。若能遇上，定要与他同游一番。你要不要与我同去找他？",
      "digest": "22e1552a",
      "fileName": "n17.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n17",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n17.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n19",
      "emotion": "thoughtful",
      "text": "诗与抱负，自然是有的。只是李太白那样的谪仙人，怕是一落座，先要的是酒。",
      "digest": "559fff77",
      "fileName": "n19.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n19",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n19.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n20",
      "emotion": "joy",
      "text": "你倒懂他！听说他\"自称臣是酒中仙\"，剑术也好得很。真要遇上，我恐怕要被他拉着喝上三天三夜。",
      "digest": "1ada4869",
      "fileName": "n20.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n20",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n20.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "lineId": "dufu",
      "kind": "period",
      "audioQuestId": "p1",
      "locationId": "",
      "periodId": "p1",
      "nodeId": "n20a",
      "emotion": "calm",
      "text": "对了，这一路与你说了这许多，还没顾上听你问。你心里若有什么想问的——家世也好，我的诗也好，尽管开口，我定知无不言。",
      "digest": "4ab22e9a",
      "fileName": "n20a.mp3",
      "audioKey": "dufu/p1/n20a",
      "cloudPath": "audio/voice/dufu/p1/n20a.mp3",
      "reason": "无旧清单可证明音频版本"
    }
  ]
}
